    "name": "Thunderwave",
    "level": 1,
    "description": "<p>You unleash a wave of thunderous energy. Each creature in a 15-foot Cube originating from you makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d8 Thunder damage and is pushed 10 feet away from you. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only.</p><p>In addition, unsecured objects that are entirely within the Cube are pushed 10 feet away from you, and a thunderous boom is audible within 300 feet.</p>",
    "school": "evocation",
    "classIds": ["bard", "druid", "sorcerer", "wizard"],
